{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Skill Pack : Card of Horror is an expansion featuring six terrifying skills wielded by otherworldly monsters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Six eerie skills and brand-new costumes will strike fear into your battles, cornering your opponents with dreadful power.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <i>MONSTER CARDS</i>, cards can be exchanged as files, so even players who do not own this DLC can still play with cards that use these skills. <br><u>What this DLC provides is the right to generate cards with these skills yourself.</u></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>During Early Access, even if you don\u2019t own this DLC, you can still generate cards with the included skills.</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Included Skills</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Chaser</strong>\u00a0<strong>[Standard]</strong>: Moves next to a chosen player in turn order.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Grudge [Standard]</strong>: Inflicts \u201cCurse\u201d on a defeated player.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>In The Dark [GameChanger]</strong>: Temporarily shrouds cards on the field in darkness.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Jumpscare [Discard]</strong>: All players must discard their low-rarity cards.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Petrifying Fear [GameChanger]</strong>: Reduces the maximum hand size.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Severance [Standard]</strong>: Attacks from this card cannot be healed.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2018673/extras/334feaaea331ac627200b9dacb0c0810.avif?t=1757004570\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>New Costumes</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Total costume parts included: <strong>22</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2018673/extras/c8565d19ca150357ab5f635394437d54.avif?t=1757004570\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2018673?t=1757004570","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2018673?t=1757004570","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2018673/fcb289ce5105249e6718d6797d540fde2f1bab6d/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1757004570","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2018673/fcb289ce5105249e6718d6797d540fde2f1bab6d/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1757004570","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Downloadable Content","id":21}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Skill Pack : Card of Horror is an expansion featuring six terrifying skills wielded by otherworldly monsters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Six eerie skills and brand-new costumes will strike fear into your battles, cornering your opponents with dreadful power.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <i>MONSTER CARDS</i>, cards can be exchanged as files, so even players who do not own this DLC can still play with cards that use these skills. <br><u>What this DLC provides is the right to generate cards with these skills yourself.</u></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>During Early Access, even if you don\u2019t own this DLC, you can still generate cards with the included skills.</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph